  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday Night through Thursday)\nIssued at 1136 PM CDT Thu Oct 22 2026\n\nThe warm weather will continue into early next week despite a\ncontinued increase in high level cloudiness. An upper level\ndisturbance passing to our north will result in increased mid\nlevel cloudiness Monday night into early Tuesday, and a few light\nshowers may brush the northwest corner of the forecast area\ndespite a very dry low level airmass.\n\nRain chances do look to increase during the latter half of next\nweek although models differ in the details. The consensus suggests\nthat a frontal passage is unlikely during the next week, so\ntemperatures look to remain above normal for most if not all of\nthe rest of the month.",
